#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:83
msgid "1. How to Create a Task"
msgstr "1. Como Criar uma Tarefa"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:85 templates/tasks/tutorials.html:111
msgid "Step 1"
msgstr "Passo 1"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:86
msgid "Click on the <strong>\"+\" (plus)</strong> icon or the <strong>\"Add Task\"</strong> button on the top bar."
msgstr "Clique no ícone de <strong>\"+\" (mais)</strong> ou no botão <strong>\"Add Task\"</strong> na barra superior."

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:89 templates/tasks/tutorials.html:115
msgid "Step 2"
msgstr "Passo 2"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:90
msgid ""
"Fill in the <strong>Name</strong> and <strong>Description</strong> of the task. These should be clear so the executor"
" understands the goal."
msgstr ""
"Preencha o <strong>Nome</strong> e a <strong>Descrição</strong> da tarefa. Estes devem ser claros para que o executor"
" entenda o objetivo."

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:93 templates/tasks/tutorials.html:119
msgid "Step 3"
msgstr "Passo 3"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:94
msgid "Set the <strong>Estimated Time</strong> (Days and Hours) and the <strong>Difficulty</strong> level."
msgstr "Defina o <strong>Tempo Estimado</strong> (Dias e Horas) e o nível de <strong>Dificuldade</strong>."

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:97 templates/tasks/tutorials.html:123
msgid "Step 4"
msgstr "Passo 4"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:98
msgid "Add participants:"
msgstr "Adicione participantes:"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:100
msgid "Stakeholder:"
msgstr "Stakeholder:"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:100
msgid "Who will evaluate the task."
msgstr "Quem irá avaliar a tarefa."

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:101
msgid "Executor:"
msgstr "Executor:"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:101
msgid "Who will perform the work."
msgstr "Quem irá realizar o trabalho."

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:105
msgid "Step 5"
msgstr "Passo 5"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:106
msgid ""
"Click <strong>\"Submit\"</strong> to save. The executor will be notified (if invited by email) or see the task in "
"their Inbox."
msgstr ""
"Clique em <strong>\"Submit\"</strong> para salvar. O executor será notificado (se convidado por e-mail) ou verá a "
"tarefa em sua Inbox."

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:109
msgid "2. How to Execute and Evaluate a Task"
msgstr "2. Como Executar e Avaliar uma Tarefa"

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:112
msgid ""
"Go to your <strong>Inbox</strong> (Main page). Locate the task and click on the <strong>Status badge</strong> (e.g., "
"\"Doing\") to change it."
msgstr ""
"Vá para sua <strong>Inbox</strong> (Página Principal). Localize a tarefa e clique no <strong>badge de Status</strong>"
" (ex: \"Doing\") para alterá-lo."

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:116
msgid "When the work is finished, click on the status badge and select <strong>\"Done\"</strong>."
msgstr "Quando o trabalho estiver concluído, clique no badge de status e selecione <strong>\"Done\"</strong>."

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:120
msgid ""
"A popup will appear asking for your <strong>Effectiveness Rating</strong>. Choose a value from 1 to 5 based on how "
"well you performed the task under current conditions."
msgstr ""
"Um popup aparecerá solicitando sua <strong>Nota de Eficácia</strong>. Escolha um valor de 1 a 5 baseado em quão bem "
"você realizou a tarefa sob as condições atuais."

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:124
msgid ""
"After clicking a rating, the task status will update to <strong>Done</strong>, and the Stakeholder will be able to "
"provide their final evaluation."
msgstr ""
"Após clicar na nota, o status da tarefa será atualizado para <strong>Done</strong>, e o Stakeholder poderá fornecer "
"sua avaliação final."

